<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello,<br>I own an MD9600 version 3, and I would like to know which new firmware I can install on my device to get the latest features. I noticed that this forum offers firmware updates for V1, V2, V4, and V5, but V3 is not listed. <br><br><img src="https://i.postimg.cc/h4bV5qW2/versionmd9600.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br>Thanks <br><br>Sébastien</div></blockquote>The version number relates to the specifics of the hardware, because the IF and PLL chips have changed in the different versions of MD9600<br><br>Try the V2 or V3 and see which one receives and transmits<br><br>i.e the menus etc will all work, regardless of which version you install, but the radio won't transmit or receive if you load the wrong version.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Oct 31, 2024 8:27 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
